ATHENA ships scalable OpenType fonts under ATHENA/fonts/truetype together with
virtual-font and encoding data used by the modern font stack.  The bundled font
families retain their respective upstream licenses; consult the license records
embedded in the font files and any family-specific license documents in their
directories (for example, the STIX license PDF).

The historical TFM, PK, Metafont, and Type 1/PFB font collection is no longer
part of ATHENA.  LATEX_LICENSE is retained for remaining data derived from the
historic TeXmacs font resources where that license applies; it is not a blanket
license for every bundled OpenType family.
